### Get all books
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books

### Get book by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/3

### Create book
POST http://localhost:3000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "harry poter",
  "author": {
    "id": 2
  },
  "gender": {
    "id": 2
  },
  "publisher": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

### Updated book
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/books/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "title": "harry potter",
  "author": {
    "id": 2
  },
  "gender": {
    "id": 2
  },
  "publisher": {
    "id": 1
  }
}


### Delete book
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/books/3


