### Get all books copies
GET http://localhost:3000/api/book_copies

### GET book by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/book_copies/1


### Create book copy
POST http://localhost:3000/api/book_copies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "is_available": true,
  "condition": "GOOD",
  "book": {
    "id": 3
  }
}
###
### Update book copy
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/book_copies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "is_available": true,
  "condition": "NEW",
  "book": {
    "id": 3
  }
}

###
### Delete book copy
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/book_copies/5

